            "collection-ids": [],
            "custom_css": "/* Esconde o título \".\" e mantém só a contagem, discreta */\n.gw-rv-main-slider-widget__title .gw-text--heading-lg { display: none; }\n.gw-rv-main-slider-widget__title .gw-text--body-lg {\n  font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #a77a32; margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n/* Cartões no estilo premium */\n.gw-rv-slider-item__card {\n  border: 1px solid rgba(167,122,50,.22);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(43,31,20,.045);\n  transition: transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease;\n}\n.gw-rv-slider-item__card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(43,31,20,.085);\n}\n.gw-rv-slider-item__content { background: #faf7f1; padding: 18px 18px 20px; }\n\n/* Tipografia: nome em serifa, texto neutro */\n.gw-rv-slider-item__review-author .gw-text {\n  font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  font-weight: 400; font-size: 17px; color: #211b16;\n}\n.gw-rv-slider-item__content .gw-text { color: #746a61; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n/* Estrelas no dourado da marca */\n.gw-rv-avg-rating__star { color: #bd9558; }"
          }
